BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Woodland: Canvass with Team Thompson\, Mayra Vega and Jesse Ortiz
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T120000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261018T143000
UID:25d7e0dfd7faf98154cf6f2d2b32ecc1@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/Mike%20Thompson%20for%20Congress%20logo_20261012014932105770.
 png
DESCRIPTION:Join Team Thompson\, Mayra Vega for Yolo County Supervisor and
  Jesse Ortiz for Woodland City Council for canvassing on Sunday October 18
 th\, 2026 at 12:00 PM in Woodland. Location will be provided upon RSVP. Fi
 rst time canvassing? No worries\, we will do a live training to answer any
  questions you might have! For questions\, contact Thomas at thomas@miketh
 ompsonforcongress.com or 631-258-1976.
LOCATION:Woodland\, CA
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/dccc/event/1062161/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:[Yolo County] Self-Directed Door Knocking — Eric Jones for Congr
 ess (CA-4)
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T210000
UID:f82594228aa15dfdd8e930bc877cdb11@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/yolo-county-1200x630_20260728084651526596.png
DESCRIPTION:Knock doors on your own schedule\, anywhere in the Yolo County
  portion of CA-4. Self-directed canvassing means you pick the day\, get yo
 ur turf\, and go. There's no launch event to show up to and no meeting spo
 t. We'll get you set up beforehand. BEFORE YOUR FIRST SHIFT Your County Ca
 ptain is Mel Halem. She'll reach out after you sign up to get you literatu
 re and a turf assignment. We also run a volunteer Slack with a channel for
  every county in the district. You'll get the invite when you sign up. 
LOCATION:Your neighborhood — Yolo County\, Yolo County\, CA\, 95616
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/ericjonesforcongress/event/998281/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
