BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:No Kings: Vote Early Albert J Boro Community Center\, San Rafael\,
  CA
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261017T120000
UID:edc1aaef49336c0cbd0f54c9d07ab675@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/organization/NKVE_1200x630_20260827192438781971.png
DESCRIPTION:In Marin\, we’re gathering near drop boxes and on overpasses
  to spread the word: **vote early**! That’s our message to everyone who 
 passes by one of our gatherings. We’re asking everyone who attends one o
 f the actions throughout Marin to bring their completed ballot in their se
 aled and signed envelope and deposit it in the drop box. We’re even maki
 ng No Kings-branded “I Voted Early” to pass out to everyone who\, you 
 guessed it\, votes early. **We decide who represents us. We decide what co
 mes next.
LOCATION:Albert J. Boro Community Center\, 50 Canal St\, San Rafael\, CA\,
  94901
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/nokings/event/1041514/
X-SOURCE:Indivisible Sonoma County (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
